I left out the `aap:caps/http-client` import and the enrichment call. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/state-read`, and the graph definition has not been updated to grant anything else. The requested call would also send each item's untrusted feed text to an external host, and its result would be discarded, so the node would be leaking data over a channel it has no authority for. If the platform team has approved the grant, it needs to go into the graph's `with` clause first. Once that's in place, I can add the import and the call.

